<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 38.57 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 38.57 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 38.57 million rand worth of South African bonds on Monday after selling 266.98 million rand on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
